                "The script is missing an explicit memory request. The original PBS script also omitted this. For a job running 21 concurrent R processes, this is a significant stability risk, as the total memory usage could easily exceed system defaults, causing the job to be killed.",
                "The script is extremely non-portable. It uses hardcoded, user-specific absolute paths for the output file and the working directory. It will fail for any other user or if the directory structure changes.",
